# Rust
/target/
/target-*/

# Preprocessor dumps from in-place json=check (not fixtures)
tests/fixtures/**/model/

# The preprocessor writes its output into its *working directory*, not next to
# the .mod it was given, so a probe run started inside this crate drops
# `+<stem>/` and `<stem>/` at the root. The `+` form is MATLAB package syntax
# and nothing hand-written here uses it. The bare `<stem>/` form is not covered
# (a stem is any identifier), which is why probes belong under %TEMP%.
/+*/

